  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-06T20:20:21.574Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nCurrently you have no way to press `Enter` on the Keyboard that appears when you click in a Video URL Field. This makes it impossible to start the Video on some Video Players that require you to press `Enter` to Start a Video.\n# Suggestion:\nI have 3 ideas of how this could be improved:\n1. Add an `Okay & Enter` Button next to the `Okay` button. (would press enter and then close the keyboard)\n2. Make the `Okay` button also press Enter instead of just closing the Keyboard.\n3. Add a separate `Enter` button to the Keyboard.\nThis would make it way easier to also start the Video that you are trying to watch, a lot of Videolplayers sadly have no other way then pressing Enter in the Input field to start the Video.",
